    Mg        8.23e-4
    Na        4.35e-3
    Cl        4.23e-3
    C(4)      1.0e-3
    Citrate   7.9323e-04  # 150 mg/L
    
SURFACE 1  Soil surface sites
    Hfo_wOH   1.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
